Read `AGENTS.md`. This repo is UI only.

- Never talk to MT5 or IB from the browser.
- Never place orders from the UI. Kill switch / flatten are API config writes.
- Symbol maps need an explicit human confirm.
- Do not persist trading passwords in localStorage.
- No `Co-authored-by` on commits.
